OK, it now it's like that; basically, all the multi-ascension trophies in the
recognition series no longer exclude a player with a higher trophy from being
eligible.

This dramatically changed the clan scoring (though rgrn is still in front),
moving rgrn from 71 points to 126.

This means, to take one example, that marvin's score on the recognition series
(instead of 12, as it was before) is now 33; as usual, by himself he's got a
higher score than most _entire clans_ ... ;-)

It also means that the Recognition trophies potentially matter _far_ more than
the others in calculation the Best in Show; this may or may not be what we want
here.

It also pushed the time-to-calculate for the scoreboard page to over a minute.
;-)

Please let me know what y'all think of this change.

